# 默认按文本处理：仓库内统一 LF，检出时不做转换。
# Windows 检出默认会把 LF 转成 CRLF，导致依赖精确字节/行尾的测试失败
# （例如 packages/db/src/migrate-sqlite.test.ts 按 '\n' 匹配 sqlite-baseline.sql）。
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制资源不做行尾转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.eot binary
*.mp3 binary
*.mp4 binary
*.zip binary
*.pdf binary
